<title>USA: Beaver County, Pa., GOs yield 5.8 pct in 2012.</title>
<headline>Beaver County, Pa., GOs yield 5.8 pct in 2012.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commonwealth Securities and Investments Inc said Tuesday it tentatively priced Beaver County, Pa.'s $56.98 million general obligation bond deal to yield 5.80 percent in 2012. The term bonds were not reoffered.</p>
